# .gitignore for Modular RAG Framework
# Prevents accidental commits of sensitive files, build artifacts, and environment-specific data

---
## SECRETS & CREDENTIALS — CRITICAL ⚠️
---
# Environment variables with sensitive data
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
credentials/

# Local Claude Code preferences (user-specific)
.claude.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local Claude Code <-> Codex review handoff
.review/codex-review.md
.review/codex-review-pass1.md
.review/handoff.md

---
